{"title":"东莞：8月1日起，全市房屋市政工程全过程应用数字化图纸！不再单独编制纸质版竣工图纸！","date":"2024-07-05","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">东莞：<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起，全市房屋市政工程全过程应用数字化图纸！不再单独编制纸质版竣工图纸！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">刚刚（<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>日），东莞市住建局发布《关于推进房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程图纸全过程数字化管理的通知》。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<section data-role=\"list\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: collapse; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:华文中宋\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">2024</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black\">，<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">在工程建设项目勘察设计、施工图审查、消防设计审查、行政审批、工程质量安全监管、竣工验收、消防验收（备案）等环节</strong>，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">全面应用数字化图纸</strong></span>。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:华文中宋\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">建设单位</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black\">组织施工、监理单位在<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>竣工图管理<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>栏目确认施工图设计单位、工程变更等信息，确认核实后，各单位线上加盖竣工专用章，完成竣工图编制，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">无需另行编制纸质竣工图纸。</strong></span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 21pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:华文中宋\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">以同一套电子图纸为依据，各环节中对图纸有修改、变更的，应在同一套图纸上进行变更</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black\">，变更记录全程留痕可追溯。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">原文如下：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋;\">关于推进房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程图纸全过程数字化管理的通知</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">各有关单位：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">为贯彻落实国务院关于工程建设项目审批制度改革部署，按照《住房城乡建设部办公厅关于开展工程建设项目全生命周期数字化管理改革试点工作的通知》（建办厅函〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">291</span>号）要求，我局现决定实施房屋建筑和市政基础设施施工图设计文件全过程数字化管理，现就有关事项通知如下：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt;font-weight:\r\nnormal\">一、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">实施目标</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">全面应用数字化图纸，依托<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>，统一全市房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程建设过程中所产生的数字化图纸信息，<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">实现各方参建主体和施工图审查机构对图纸的审查、变更、确认、验收等在线业务协同，项目设计、施工、竣工、归档全过程<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>一套图<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>闭环管理。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">二、实施范围</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">东莞市行政区域内，新建、改建、扩建的房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程建设项目</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（有保密要求的、非住房城乡建设监管领域的建设项目除外）。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">三、实施日期</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 18.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 18.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">2024</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">，<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">在工程建设项目勘察设计、施工图审查、消防设计审查、行政审批、工程质量安全监管、竣工验收、消防验收（备案）等环节</strong>，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">全面应用数字化图纸</strong></span>。<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">建设单位不再单独编制纸质版竣工图纸</strong></span>，通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>组织编制、上传竣工图纸。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 18.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">四、图纸流转程序</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 18.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">在工程建设项目勘察设计、施工图审查、消防设计审查、行政审批、工程质量安全监管、竣工验收、消防验收（备案）等环节，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">以同一套电子图纸为依据，各环节中对图纸有修改、变更的，应在同一套图纸上进行变更</strong></span>，变更记录全程留痕可追溯。具体如下：</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（一）施工图阶段。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">勘察设计单位通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>上传施工图设计文件，施工图审查机构审查通过后，电子图纸供建设过程监督环节使用，审查结果供施工许可、消防等行政审批业务使用。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（二）施工阶段。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">质量安全监督机构以审查通过的电子图纸作为监督工程按图施工的依据。建设过程中施工图纸发生变化的，由建设单位（设计单位）及时将变更后的电子图纸上传<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 18.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（三）竣工验收阶段。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">建设单位组织施工、监理单位在<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>竣工图管理<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>栏目确认施工图设计单位、工程变更等信息，确认核实后，各单位线上加盖竣工专用章，完成竣工图编制，<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">无需另行编制纸质竣工图纸</strong></span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.6pt; line-height: 18.75pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">五、工作要求</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（一）落实图纸上传。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">建设、勘察、设计、施工、监理单位在工程建设各环节按要求上传电子图纸</strong>，过程发生变化的，及时在<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>广东省施工图设计文件审查管理系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>上传变更电子图纸，保障工程的竣工验收工作顺畅。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（二）做好服务指导。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">各镇街（园区）住房和城乡建设局应积极向各项目传达图纸全过程数字化的工作要求，持续跟进辖区内图纸全过程数字化应用情况，做好对企业的服务与指导工作，及时汇总问题反馈至我局。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（三）加强宣传培训。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">我局持续强化工程建设项目图纸全过程数字化管理的宣传，适时开展图纸全过程数字化管理操作培训。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: right;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: right;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: right;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: right;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">东莞市住房和城乡建设局</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: right; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>日</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}